{"slug":"Universal-Script-YouTube-Music-Player-V8-236600","_id":"6a2ec80c762d1454d08c3691","title":"YouTube Music Player V8","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/0-1781450764084.jpg","placeId":0},"features":"🎵 Introducing the all-new YouTube Music Player Script V8.5!\n\nTake your Roblox experience to the next level by listening to your favorite music or watching YouTube videos while you play. Version 8.5 brings major improvements, new features, and a smoother experience than ever before.\n\n✨ Features\n\n🌍 Automatic Language Translation\n\n- The interface automatically detects your language and translates the entire GUI in real time.\n\n🔎 Smart YouTube Search\n\n- Search and download YouTube videos, music, and even Roblox Audio IDs instantly—without leaving the game.\n\n▶️ Complete Media Controls\n\n- Play\n- Pause\n- Next Track\n- Previous Track\n- Fast Forward\n- Rewind (10 seconds)\n\n🖥️ Floating Mini Player\n\n- Watch videos or control your music through a compact, movable Mini Player while you continue playing.\n\n🔁 Multiple Playback Modes\n\n- Auto Skip\n- Loop Current Track\n- Shuffle\n\n🎚️ Advanced Audio Customization\n\n- Adjust Volume\n- Change Pitch\n- Fine-tune Audio Frequencies\n- Apply up to 13 built-in sound effects to personalize your listening experience.\n\n🎶 Powerful Playlist Manager\nOrganize your media with dedicated categories:\n\n- All\n- Music\n- Videos\n- Roblox Audio IDs\n- Favorites\n\nAnd Search & Delete\n\n🌍 Global Chat\nChat with YouTube Music Player users from around the world—including members of our Discord community—with automatic real-time translation.\n\n🔇 One-Click Game Audio Mute\nInstantly mute in-game sounds for a cleaner and more immersive music or video experience.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n⚠️ Important\n\nThis script runs entirely on the client side, meaning only you can hear the music or watch the videos. If you'd like other players to hear the audio as well, consider using Roblox Voice Chat.","tags":["music","audio","music player","Boombox"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dan41/Roblox-Scripts/refs/heads/main/Youtube%20Music%20Player/YoutubeMusicPlayer.lua'),true))()","owner":{"_id":"6a0ba154a40166ad01be289a","username":"Termux404","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6a0ba154a40166ad01be289a-1779147421611.jpg","status":"offline","id":"6a0ba154a40166ad01be289a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000}},"verified":false,"views":16428,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/0-1781450764084.jpg","likeCount":9,"dislikeCount":7,"createdAt":"2026-06-14T15:26:04.102Z","keyLink":"","executes":571291,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":462026,"at":"2026-09-29T05:45:00.006Z"},{"key":"script.executions","tier":100000,"value":462026,"at":"2026-09-29T05:45:00.006Z"}],"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a2ec80c762d1454d08c3693","editBy":{"_id":"6a0ba154a40166ad01be289a","username":"Termux404","status":"offline","id":"6a0ba154a40166ad01be289a"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-06-14T15:26:04.105Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6a2ed529cf7067847233eabe","commentBy":{"_id":"69a233ddfd5c65fb0a360e7b","username":"alsotwentycharacters","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/photo/69a233ddfd5c65fb0a360e7b-1788900342011.png","lastActive":"2026-09-30T14:50:50.712Z","createdAt":"2026-02-28T00:16:29.143Z","status":"offline","id":"69a233ddfd5c65fb0a360e7b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"text":"i mean hey if this is actually good (im using pot*ium, the goat) then i may use this regularly","edited":false,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-06-14T16:22:01.372Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6a2edde1d7d7c359b8702b3e","commentBy":{"_id":"6a2edd9741b951e3